  - Implemented `aria-pressed` attribute for queue selection items to indicate their toggle state.
  - Set `aria-live="polite"` on the awaiting-review queue container to announce dynamic content changes to screen readers.
  - Added an `useEffect` hook to allow closing the nanopublish confirmation overlay with the Escape key.
